{"type":"message","message":{"id":"gen-1775255852-V5aK5Z36En5PTvex2Tyy","role":"assistant","created":1775255861,"content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now I understand the data structure. Black Monday was October 19, 1987, so the last calendar year quarter of that year would be Q4 1987. Then I need data for Q4 1988, Q4 1989, and Q4 1990.\n\nThe available data covers:\n- Treasury Bulletin March 1988 - would contain Q4 1987 data\n- Treasury Bulletin March 1989 - would contain Q4 1988 data\n- Treasury Bulletin March 1990 - would contain Q4 1989 data\n- Treasury Bulletin March 1991 - would contain Q4 1990 data\n\nLet me look at one of the JSON files to understand the structure of the data.\n","signature":""},{"type":"toolRequest","id":"call_38d73153bb4a8cc7","toolCall":{"status":"success","value":{"name":"shell","arguments":{"command":"head -c 5000 /app/resources/treasury_bulletin_1988_03.json"}}},"_meta":{"goose_extension":"developer"}}],"metadata":{"userVisible":true,"agentVisible":true}}}
{"type":"message","message":{"id":"msg_09a0f4a8-cc12-4b91-b662-96cc5e905d03","role":"user","created":1775255861,"content":[{"type":"toolResponse","id":"call_38d73153bb4a8cc7","toolResult":{"status":"success","value":{"content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\"document\": {\"elements\": [{\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [246, 209, 436, 262], \"page_id\": 1}], \"content\": \"\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 0, \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [246, 557, 345, 610], \"page_id\": 1}], \"content\": \"\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 1, \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [246, 775, 345, 792], \"page_id\": 1}], \"content\": \"\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 2, \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [20, 3, 138, 202], \"page_id\": 3}], \"content\": \"Tree\\nHJ\\n10\\nA2\\n988\\nc.1\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 0, \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [635, 906, 802, 1047], \"page_id\": 3}], \"content\": \"LIBRARY ROOM 5030 APR 11 19\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 1, \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [591, 1068, 852, 1128], \"page_id\": 3}], \"content\": \"TREASURY DEPARTMENT\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 2, \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [170, 196, 896, 248], \"page_id\": 7}], \"content\": \"TREASURY BULLETIN\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 0, \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [0, 344, 1131, 998], \"page_id\": 7}], \"content\": null, \"description\": null, \"id\": 1, \"type\": \"figure\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [425, 1057, 622, 1122], \"page_id\": 7}], \"content\": \"Winter Issue March 1988\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 2, \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [64, 1155, 494, 1251], \"page_id\": 7}], \"content\": \"Office of the Secretary Department of the Treasury Washington, D.C.\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 3, \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [651, 1156, 997, 1251], \"page_id\": 7}], \"content\": \"Compiled by Financial Management Service\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 4, \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [475, 1299, 586, 1406], \"page_id\": 7}], \"content\": null, \"description\": null, \"id\": 5, \"type\": \"figure\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [155, 243, 1005, 270], \"page_id\": 8}], \"content\": \"ADDITIONAL TREASURY RELEASES ON FEDERAL FINANCES\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 0, \"type\": \"section_header\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [83, 345, 1074, 390], \"page_id\": 8}], \"content\": \"Sold on a subscription basis only (exceptions noted) by the Superintendent of Documents U.S. Government Printing Office, Washington, D.C. 20402 (phone orders: (202) 783-3238):\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 1, \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [180, 415, 1077, 511], \"page_id\": 8}], \"content\": \"Daily Treasury Statement. Provides summary data on the Treasury's cash and debt operations for the Federal Government. Published each Federal working day by the Financial Management Service. Subscription price: $110 per year (domestic), $137 per year (foreign).\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 2, \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [181, 533, 1077, 603], \"page_id\": 8}], \"content\": \"Monthly Statement of the Public Debt of the United States. Provides summary and detailed information on the public debt outstanding. Prepared by the Bureau of the Public Debt. Subscription price: $25 per year (domestic), $31.25 per year (foreign).\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 3, \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [181, 627, 1076, 748], \"page_id\": 8}], \"content\": \"Monthly Treasury Statement of Receipts and Outlays of the United States Government. Provides Federal budget results, including receipts and outlays of funds, the surplus or deficit, and the means of financing the deficit or disposing of the surplus. Prepared by the Financial Management Service, based on agency reporting. Subscription price: $22 per year (domestic), $27.50 per year (foreign).\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 4, \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [179, 771, 1076, 842], \"page_id\": 8}], \"content\": \"Consolidated Financial Statements of the United States Government (annual). Provides information about Government financial operations on a consolidated basis. Compiled by the Financial Management Service. Single copy price: $2.25\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 5, \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [180, 865, 1076, 981], \"page_id\": 8}], \"content\": \"United States Government Annual Report and Appendix. Annual Report presents budgetary results at the summary level. Appendix presents the individual receipt and appropriation accounts at the detail level. Compiled by the Financial Management Service. Annual Report single copy price: $2.00; Appendix free from Financial Management Service.\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 6, \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [245, 1053, 1002, 1104], \"page_id\": 8}], \"content\": \"For your convenience, a subscription order form for the Treasury Bulletin is located on the inside back cover of this issue.\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 7, \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [187, 279, 874, 334], \"page_id\": 9}], \"content\": \"TREASURY BULLETIN\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 0, \"type\": \"section_header\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [1, 418, 1073, 962], \"page_id\": 9}], \"content\": null, \"description\": null, \"id\": 1, \"type\": \"figure\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [140, 1088, 522, 1177], \"page_id\": 9}], \"content\": \"Office of the Secretary Department of the Treasury Washington, D.C.\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 2, \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [642, 1088, 955, 1177], ","annotations":{"priority":0.0}}],"structuredContent":{"stdout":"{\"document\": {\"elements\": [{\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [246, 209, 436, 262], \"page_id\": 1}], \"content\": \"\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 0, \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [246, 557, 345, 610], \"page_id\": 1}], \"content\": \"\", \"descript