{"type":"message","message":{"id":"gen-1775255921-6yuySFpb8V2xO3Xr9Za7","role":"assistant","created":1775255927,"content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now I can see the 1988 Q4 data (which would be for the 1988 bulletin covering Oct-Dec 1988):\n- October 1988: $9,014 million accepted (2-year notes)\n- November 1988: $9,027 million accepted (2-year notes)\n- December 1988: $9,036 million accepted (2-year notes)\n\nSo for 1988 Q4, the average would be: (90014 + 9027 + 9036)/3 = 27,077/3 = 9,025.67 million\n\nNow I need to do the same for the other years. Let me check 1990 and 1991 bulletins as well.\n","signature":""},{"type":"toolRequest","id":"call_7f222de5f62230bc","toolCall":{"status":"success","value":{"name":"shell","arguments":{"command":"grep -n \"Auction of 2-Year\" /app/resources/treasury_bulletin_1990_03.txt"}}},"_meta":{"goose_extension":"developer"}}],"metadata":{"userVisible":true,"agentVisible":true}}}
